  "details": "about 5 months or less have passed since the Update that made it tremendously slow to type on the keyboard inside of VRChat while in PCVR, 50% of the times the button doesn't get pressed despite me pressing the whole trigger\n\ni did try to use the steam keyboard to input text into the chat and the steam keyboard works just fine, so it is the VRChat keyboard to miss 50% of the input, this is so bad that i can no longer play while i can't talk or i will not be able to chat as fast as i used to, it does take me far longer, the same update also introduced the probability for your UI to break and become unable to select users with the launch pad open.\n\nRECAP:\n\nthe VRChat's keyboard ignores 50% of the user input.",
